# Port patch 0336 (2026-11-10): who skins a model (the jobs of 0324/0325)
# calls re4_skin_head_fn after each info's vertices: the 3DS converts the heads of the display lists that read them
# on that thread, mostly the game while it waits for the GX thread (gx_decode.cpp, RE4_3DS_HEADJOB). re4_skin_gen:
# the jobs' generation; with the hook set the record after the jobs goes into the ring every frame (it names the
# generation). Linux: the hook is NULL, as before.
diff -ruN a/src/game/trans.cpp b/src/game/trans.cpp
--- a/src/game/trans.cpp	2026-11-10 17:57:15.478271082 +0900
